Usage: ms help [command | code...] [--json]

Show the command list, or detailed usage for one command.
Given diagnostic codes from ms check --json (MS and MSL), print each code's rule family and usual repair;
apply the diagnostic's own fix field first when it has one. --json emits versioned JSON for codes.

Options:
  -h, --help  Show this help without executing the command

Examples:
  ms help
  ms help run
  ms help MS3060
  ms help MS2001 MSL110 --json
